{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23477","headline":"留题天竺灵隐两寺 · 白居易","name":"留题天竺灵隐两寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"在郡六百日，入山十二回。\n宿因月桂落，醉爲海榴开。\n黄纸除书到，青宫诏命催。\n僧徒多怅望，宾从亦裴回。\n寺闇烟埋竹，林香雨落梅。\n别桥怜白石，辞洞恋青苔。\n渐出松间路，犹飞马上桮。\n谁教冷泉水，送我下山来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23477.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23477","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}